{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 205777, "name": "", "username": "broccoli", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/51a2da/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-08-12T18:39:44.874Z", "cooked": "<p>The “Install package X” prompt is really annoying since I miss type <em>a lot</em> I figured that it is provide by the <code>/etc/profile.d/PackageKit.sh</code>. I know I can delete it, but when the next release comes it will be back, so I want to know if I can somehow remove/disable it permanently.</p>\n<p>I was thinking that I could rewrite my user <code>.bashrc</code> to not load it, but then I would have to basically rewrite the whole system <code>bashrc</code> which could change on new release, so that again seems pointless.</p>\n<p>Another idea that I had is to just not source the system <code>bashrc</code> but that seems potentially stupid</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T20:35:45.795Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1233, "reads": 41, "readers_count": 40, "score": 6218.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72189, "topic_slug": "disabling-packagekit-sh", "display_username": "", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10253, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/disabling-packagekit-sh/72189/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 140261, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2022-08-12T18:51:13.255Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/broccoli\">@broccoli</a> , welcome to the community. Please take a look at the introductory posts in the <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#start-here</span> category if you’ve not had a chance yet.</p>\n<p>This function is provided by the <code>PackageKit-command-not-found</code> package, so you can uninstall that:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">sudo dnf remove PackageKit-command-not-found\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2022-08-12T18:51:13.255Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 42, "reads": 40, "readers_count": 39, "score": 238.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72189, "topic_slug": "disabling-packagekit-sh", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/not-being-asked-su-password/180100/2", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "Not being asked su password", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [{"id": 10253, "username": "broccoli", "name": "", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/51a2da/{size}.png"}], "post_url": "/t/disabling-packagekit-sh/72189/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 140266, "name": "", "username": "broccoli", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/51a2da/{size}.png", "created_at": "2022-08-12T19:02:35.847Z", "cooked": "<p>Thank you! It didn’t even occur to me that it could be a package since it’s just a script</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:39:21.604Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 6, "reads": 34, "readers_count": 33, "score": 86.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72189, "topic_slug": "disabling-packagekit-sh", "display_username": "", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2, "username": "sanja", "name": "Sanja", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10253, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/disabling-packagekit-sh/72189/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 163675, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2022-08-15T07:58:26.531Z", "cooked": "<p>You can find what package a file belongs to using <code>rpm</code> (for packages installed on your system), and using <code>dnf</code> for packages in the repositories:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\"># I don't have PackageKit-command-not-found installed, so a different file:\n$ rpm -qf /etc/profile.d/flatpak.sh \nflatpak-1.12.7-5.fc36.x86_64\n</code></pre>\n<p>With dnf:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">$ sudo dnf whatprovides '/etc/profile.d/PackageKit.sh'\nPackageKit-command-not-found-1.2.5-1.fc36.x86_64 : Ask the user to install command line programs automatically\nRepo        : fedora\nMatched from:\nFilename    : /etc/profile.d/PackageKit.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>Now that I think of it, you can even remove the file directly with <code>dnf</code> and it will figure out the package to remove:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">sudo dnf remove /etc/profile.d/PackageKit.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>For eg:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">$ sudo dnf remove /etc/profile.d/flatpak.sh \nDependencies resolved.\n========================================================================================================================================\n Package                                       Architecture          Version                      Repository                       Size\n========================================================================================================================================\nRemoving:\n flatpak                                       x86_64                1.12.7-5.fc36                @updates                        5.4 M\nRemoving dependent packages:\n fedora-flathub-remote                         noarch                1-2.fc36                     @fedora                         5.9 k\n gnome-software                                x86_64                42.4-1.fc36                  @updates                        8.1 M\nRemoving unused dependencies:\n appstream                                     x86_64                0.15.2-1.fc36                @updates-testing                2.7 M\n appstream-data                                noarch                36-3.fc36                    @updates-testing                 13 M\n fwupd                                         x86_64                1.8.3-1.fc36                 @updates                        8.1 M\n fwupd-efi                                     x86_64                1.3-1.fc36                   @updates-testing                153 k\n fwupd-plugin-flashrom                         x86_64                1.8.3-1.fc36                 @updates                         36 k\n fwupd-plugin-modem-manager                    x86_64                1.8.3-1.fc36                 @updates                        134 k\n fwupd-plugin-uefi-capsule-data                x86_64                1.8.3-1.fc36                 @updates                        2.2 M\n libxmlb                                       x86_64                0.3.9-1.fc36                 @updates-testing                293 k\n\nTransaction Summary\n========================================================================================================================================\nRemove  11 Packages\n\nFreed space: 40 M\nIs this ok [y/N]: \n</code></pre>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:48:19.703Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 21, "reads": 29, "readers_count": 28, "score": 160.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72189, "topic_slug": "disabling-packagekit-sh", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 10253, "username": "broccoli", "name": "", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/51a2da/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 3}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/disabling-packagekit-sh/72189/4", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 3}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 3, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 132769, "name": "Scott Williams", "username": "vwbusguy", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vwbusguy/{size}/6883_2.png", "created_at": "2022-08-15T16:43:01.888Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ankursinha\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"72189\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/48/71_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FranciscoD:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>you can even remove the file directly with <code>dnf</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I had no idea you could do this.   I’ve always nested it like <code>dnf remove $(rpm -qf /path/to/file)</code>.</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T22:35:48.307Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 24, "readers_count": 23, "score": 74.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72189, "topic_slug": "disabling-packagekit-sh", "display_username": "Scott Williams", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Top 500", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2, "username": "sanja", "name": "Sanja", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 2644, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/disabling-packagekit-sh/72189/5", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 93544, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2022-08-15T20:54:18.172Z", "cooked": "<p>The “specifying packages” section of <code>man dnf</code> is worth taking a look at. My understanding is that one can use “capabilities” with dnf, which include files provided by packages, provides, and of course the package names etc.</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2022-08-15T20:54:18.172Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 9, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 79.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 72189, "topic_slug": "disabling-packagekit-sh", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 6273, "username": "epeon", "name": "Kasper van Niekerk", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/b193c8/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/disabling-packagekit-sh/72189/6", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}], "stream": [205777, 140261, 140266, 163675, 132769, 93544]}, "timeline_lookup": [[1, 1545], [4, 1542], [6, 1541]], "suggested_topics": [], "tags": [{"id": 369, "name": "f36", "slug": "f36"}, {"id": 879, "name": "bash", "slug": "bash"}], "tags_descriptions": {}, "fancy_title": "Disabling PackageKit.sh", "id": 72189, "title": "Disabling PackageKit.sh", "posts_count": 6, "created_at": "2022-08-12T18:39:44.719Z", "views": 1924, "reply_count": 4, "like_count": 9, "last_posted_at": "2022-08-15T20:54:18.172Z", "visible": true, "closed": false, "archived": false, "has_summary": false, "archetype": "regular", "slug": "disabling-packagekit-